charout at 1 : C1=0 w3 C=0 w4
   [XYZe1|line2|]
lineout at line 1 : L1=0 w5 L=0 w10
   [new|tail|e2|]
seek then charout : S=2 w2 C=0 w3
   [lQne1|line2|]
write append : C1=0 w3 L2=0 w10
   [abne1|cd|e2|]
charout past the end : C30=0 w33 L=0 w37
   [line1|line2|@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@farend|]
record append : L1=0 w5 C3=0 w4
   [abZ BBBB]
lines count after a read past the end : NOTREADY 2 NOTREADY
